{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39183","headline":"赠武处士 · 韦庄","name":"赠武处士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一身唯一室，高静若僧家。\n扫地留疎影，穿池浸落霞。\n绿萝临水合，白道向村斜。\n卖药归来醉，吟诗倚钓查。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39183.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39183","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}